      "filename": "S2_CONTEXT_narration_broll_voiceover.mp3",
      "content_type": "audio/mpeg",
      "size_bytes": 156960,
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T11:17:52.706664",
      "section_id": "S2_CONTEXT",
      "voiceover_text": "Across the AI4IA conversations, Change Climate is presented not as an abstraction, but as a challenge with concrete human consequences — for people who depend on these systems to work, and work fairly. But because AI is expected to display so many jobs and really bring a new way of working this is an important area for us in the Caribbean to make sure that we prepare our citizens for the changing demands of the digital era."
    },
