      "section_id": "S3_EVIDENCE",
      "voiceover_text": "But the arrival of AI in Change Climate does not resolve the underlying tensions. It often sharpens them — exposing who has voice, who has access, and who bears the risks. For this, the policies and legal frameworks of the governments also age. In fact, they go against the principles of sustainable development goals. You wear, beware, I am fearless, and therefore I am powerful to the monster to its maker."
